{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. Check properties and do specific task. Move randomly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
